0121bba9ec7a2c93c58836c3 3x"}, "body": "真田九五さん、こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます！\n\n私のOCサイダーを描いて欲しいです。サイダーはいろいろな髪型をしていますが、いつも瞳孔がピンクのひし形で、猫耳のような髪型をしています。目が見えている時の性格はとてもガサツで、よくしかめっ面をしています。前髪が長いときはいつも笑っている。\n\n新しい衣装のデザインを描いてほしい！コンセプトは「悪女イセカイ」！大好きなBL小説をイセカイ化。好きな髪型で描いてください。\n\nバッドエンドなシーンを描いても面白いと思います。例えば、ワインで毒を盛られるとか、見知らぬ男主人公に刺されるとか。他にアイデアがあれば、どうぞ！\n\nSNSとYoutubeに使いたいと思います！\n\nHello Sanada-san! Thank you for the appeal!\n\nI would like for you to draw my OC Cider. Cider has many hair styles, but she will always have pink diamond shaped pupils and hair that resembles cat ears. When her eyes are visible, her personality is very crass and she frowns a lot. When she has her long bangs hair, she is always smiling.\n\nI would like for you to draw my new outfit design! The concept is Villainess Isekai! She got isekai-ed into her favorite BL novel. Please draw whichever hairstyle you prefer. \n\nI think it would be fun to draw her in a \"bad ending\" scene. Examples of ideas would be her getting poisoned from a glass of wine, or being stabbed by an unknown male lead. If you have other ideas, please go ahead!\n\nI would like to use it for SNS and Youtube, thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TbgCZHIr5ifrBfe1CmOUbT9eekOWht-6", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Kugo_eya/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3274030, "client_id": 3388749, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd7190ce/uploads/origins/1d3e107e-1b9c-4e3b-a979-263fd3088964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2eeb1316f1c9d05f1347d24e9cbe2cb4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd7190ce/uploads/origins/1d3e107e-1b9c-4e3b-a979-263fd3088964?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2eeb1316f1c9d05f1347d24e9cbe2cb4, https://si.imgix.net/fd7190ce/uploads/origins/1d3e107e-1b9c-4e3b-a9